cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this benchmark, cite it as below. Cite the Sappelli et al. (2016) dataset its
  labels come from as well.
title: pingbo-bench
abstract: >-
  The benchmark behind the A40 Labs article "How Pingbo Decides What Matters": 32 models decide
  whether each of 508 annotated Enron work emails needs a reply, at four steps from a bare prompt
  to the pipeline Pingbo ships.
type: dataset
